Description: Ship Cargo.lock resolved with time 0.3.36
 Upstream's 2023 lockfile pins time 0.3.29, which no longer compiles on
 current rustc (E0282); 0.3.36 is the semver-compatible fix. This is the
 lock "cargo update -p time --precise 0.3.36" produced, with powerfmt held
 at the 0.2.0 every earlier build resolved. Running that update during the
 build instead let crates.io decide what was added: powerfmt 0.2.1
 (2026-10-05) changed the binary of a rebuild of an unchanged package.
Author: pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-06
